INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('stackconsult/RE-Engine/mcp-change-plan', 'mcp-change-plan', 'stackconsult', 'RE-Engine', 'community', 'mcp-change-plan stackconsult RE-Engine community The mcp-change-plan skill converts user requirements into detailed implementation plans, respecting RE-Engine''s architecture and production constraints, benefiting developers and engineers mcp-change-plan 是一种将用户需求转化为详细、可执行计划的 AI 工具，考虑 RE-Engine 的架构和 MCP 集成模式 mcp-change-plan は、ユーザーの要件を RE-Engine 導入計画に変換する AI エージェントです。RE-Engine のアーキテクチャと MCP 統合パターンを考慮します mcp-change-plan은 사용자 요구 사항을详细 计划으로 변환하는 AI 에이전트로, RE-Engine의 아키텍처와 MCP 통합 패턴을 고려 mcp-change-plan transforma requisitos de usuario en planes de implementación detallados y concretos, respetando la arquitectura de RE-Engine y los patrones de integración de MCP mcp-change-plan transforme les exigences des utilisateurs en plans d''implémentation détaillés et concrets, respectant l''architecture de RE-Engine et les modèles d''intégration de MCP mcp-change-plan wandelt Benutzeranforderungen in detaillierte und konkrete Implementierungspläne um, unter Berücksichtigung der RE-Engine-Architektur und der MCP-Integrationsmuster O mcp-change-plan é uma ferramenta que transforma requisitos vagos em planos de implementação detalhados com avaliação de riscos e estratégia de execução faseada mcp-change-plan - это инструмент, который преобразует нечеткие требования в детальные планы реализации с оценкой рисков и фазовой стратегией выполнения mcp-change-plan هو أداة تحول المتطلبات الغامضة إلى خطط عمل مفصلة مع تقييم المخاطر واستراتيجية التنفيذ المرحلية how to use mcp-change-plan mcp-change-plan setup guide RE-Engine implementation planning mcp-change-plan alternative mcp-change-plan vs other planning tools what is mcp-change-plan mcp-change-plan install MCP integration patterns mcp-change-plan AI 工具 RE-Engine MCP 集成模式 风险评估 分阶段执行策略 详细计划 用户需求转化 Transforms natural language goals into concrete, actionable plans Respects RE-Engine''s architecture and MCP integration patterns Includes risk assessment and phased execution strategy Requires current state documentation from @mcp-repo-scan Outputs detailed implementation plans with documentation requirements mcp-change-plan is a skill that generates detailed, RE-Engine-specific implementation plans with risk assessment and phased execution strategy');
