e extracción con documentación actualizada","fr":"pr-with-docs est un agent de flux de travail de Cursor AI qui automatise la création de demandes d''extraction avec une documentation mise à jour","de":"pr-with-docs ist ein Workflow-Agent von Cursor AI, der die Erstellung von Pull-Requests mit aktualisierter Dokumentation automatisiert","pt":"O que é PR com documentos? É um sistema de automação para o editor de código Cursor AI","ru":"Что такое PR с документами? Это система автоматизации для редактора кода Cursor AI","ar":"ما هو طلب السحب مع الوثائق؟ هو نظام تلقائي لتعديل Cursor AI"},"features":{"en":["Analyzes changes in modified, added, and deleted files in the current branch","Identifies scope of changes, including features, bug fixes, and refactors","Detects changes that require updates to AGENTS.md","Runs the Git workflow to create a pull request","Updates .cursor/rules if relevant changes are detected","Examines files to determine the need for AGENTS.md updates"],"zh":["自动分析代码变更","更新 AGENTS.md 和 .cursor/rules","运行 Git 工作流程","创建拉取请求","支持代码审查和文档更新"],"ja":["コード変更の自動分析","AGENTS.md と .cursor/rules の更新","Git ワークフローの実行","プルリクエストの作成","コードレビューとドキュメント更新のサポート"],"ko":["코드 변경의 자동 분석","AGENTS.md 및 .cursor/rules 업데이트","Git 워크플로우 실행","풀 리퀘스트 생성","코드 리뷰와 문서 업데이트의 지원"],"es":["Análisis de cambios en el código","Actualización de AGENTS.md","Ejecución del flujo de trabajo de Git","Creación de solicitudes de extracción","Automatización de tareas de desarrollo","Integración con el editor de código Cursor AI"],"fr":["Analyse des modifications de code","Mise à jour de AGENTS.md","Exécution du flux de travail Git","Création de demandes d''extraction","Automatisation des tâches de développement","Intégration avec l''éditeur de code Cursor AI"],"de":["Änderungsanalyse im Code","Aktualisierung von AGENTS.md","Ausführung des Git-Workflows","Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Automatisierung von Entwickleraufgaben","Integration mit dem Code-Editor Cursor AI"],"pt":["Análise de alterações no branch atual","Identificação do escopo: funcionalidades, correções de bugs, refatorações","Detecção de alterações que requerem atualização do AGENTS.md","Integração com o fluxo de trabalho do Git","Criação de pull requests automatizados"],"ru":["Анализ изменений в текущей ветке","Определение объема: функциональности, исправления ошибок, рефакторинг","Обнаружение изменений, требующих обновления AGENTS.md","Интеграция с рабочим процессом Git","Автоматическое создание запросов на слияние"],"ar":["تحليل التغييرات في الفرع الحالي","تحديد النطاق: الميزات، تصحيح الأخطاء، إعادة هيكلة","كشف التغييرات التي تتطلب تحديث AGENTS.md","التكامل مع تدفق العمل Git","إنشاء طلبات السحب التلقائية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs setup guide","automated pull request workflow","pr-with-docs vs manual git workflow","what is pr-with-docs","pr-with-docs install","pr-with-docs alternative","pr-with-docs tutorial","pr-with-docs and AGENTS.md","pr-with-docs for AI agents"],"zh":["PR with Docs","AI 工作流程配置","代码审查","文档更新","自动化工具","Git 工作流程","拉取请求","代码变更分析"],"ja":["PR with Docs","AIエージェント","コードレビュー","ドキュメント更新","自動化ツール","Git ワークフロー","プルリクエスト","コード変更分析"],"ko":["PR with Docs","AI 워크플로우 커서 구성","코드 리뷰","문서 업데이트","자동화 도구","Git 워크플로우","풀 리퀘스트","코드 변경 분석"],"es":["pr-with-docs","agente de flujo de trabajo","Cursor AI","automatización de desarrollo","solicitudes de extracción","documentación actualizada","Herramientas de desarrollo","Automatización de tareas","Integración con Git"],"fr":["pr-with-docs","agent de flux de travail","Cursor AI","automatisation de développement","demandes d''extraction","documentation mise à jour","Outils de développement","Automatisation de tâches","Intégration avec Git"],"de":["pr-with-docs","Workflow-Agent","Cursor AI","Automatisierung von Entwicklung","Pull-Requests","aktualisierte Dokumentation","Entwicklertools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Integration mit Git"],"pt":["ferramentas de inteligência artificial","configuração do PR com documentos","fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","Cursor AI","análise de alterações","integração com Git","criação de pull requests","desenvolvimento de software","automatização de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","настройка PR с документами","рабочий процесс разработки","Cursor AI","анализ изменений","интеграция с Git","создание запросов на слияние","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация рабочего процесса"],"ar":["آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعداد طلب السحب مع الوثائق","تدفق العمل التطويعي","Cursor AI","تحليل التغييرات","التكامل مع Git","إنشاء طلبات السحب","تطوير البرمجيات","تلقائية تدفق العمل"]}},"owner":"pmagnomuller","repo":"ai-workflow-cursor-config","repoPath":"pmagnomuller/ai-workflow-cursor-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-with-docs","description":"Creates production-ready pull requests with automatically updated AGENTS.md and project docs. Use when the user asks to create a PR, make a PR, is ready to merge, has finished a feature and wants a PR, or says theyre done for the day with changes to commit.","bodyPreview":"# PR with Docs\n\nWhen the user asks to create a pull request (e.g. \"make a PR with these changes\", \"create a PR for this\", \"ready to merge\", \"that''s all for today, I added X\"), follow this workflow to analyze changes, update AGENTS.md (and .cursor/rules if relevant), run the Git workflow, and create the PR.\n\n## 1. Change Analysis\n\n- Examine all modified, added, and deleted files in the current branch.\n- Identify scope: features, bug fixes, refactors.\n- Detect changes that require **AGENTS.md** up","body":"# PR with Docs\n\nWhen the user asks to create a pull request (e.g. \"make a PR with these changes\", \"create a PR for this\", \"ready to merge\", \"that''s all for today, I added X\"), follow this workflow to analyze changes, update AGENTS.md (and .cursor/rules if relevant), run the Git workflow, and create the PR.\n\n## 1. Change Analysis\n\n- Examine all modified, added, and deleted files in the current branch.\n- Identify scope: features, bug fixes, refactors.\n- Detect changes that require **AGENTS.md** updates:\n  - New API endpoints or routes (`apps/api/app/routes/`, `apps/web/src/app/api/`)\n  - Database schema or migrations (`apps/api/migrations/`)\n  - New environment variables or config (`apps/api/app/core/config.py`, etc.)\n  - Architecture or tech stack changes\n  - New development commands or workflows\n  - Auth flow changes\n  - New third-party integrations or dependencies\n  - New component or styling patterns\n\n## 2. AGENTS.md and Rules Updates\n\n- Read `AGENTS.md` (and relevant `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`) thoroughly.\n- Update sections based on code changes; preserve structure and tone.\n- Add new sections only for entirely new concepts.\n- Ensure code examples match current patterns; keep terminology and style consistent.\n- Do not remove information unless it is obsolete.\n- If changes affect only API or only web, consider updating `.cursor/rules/python-api.mdc` or `.cursor/rules/nextjs-web.mdc` as appropriate.\n\n## 3. Git Workflow\n\n**Branch**\n\n- Check branch: `git branch --show-current`.\n- If on `main`/`master`, create a feature branch: `<type>/<brief-description>` (e.g. `feature/add-instagram-scraping`, `fix/auth-redirect-loop`, `docs/update-schema-info`). Types: `feature`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`, `chore`.\n- If already on a feature branch, use it.\n\n**Stash**\n\n- Check uncommitted changes: `git status`.\n- If there are uncommitted changes: `git stash push -m \"Auto-stash before PR creation\"`.\n- Restore stash after operations if one was created.\n\n**Commit**\n\n- Stage docs first: `git add AGENTS.md` (and any `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` if changed).\n- Commit docs: `git commit -m \"docs: update AGENTS.md with [specific changes]\"`.\n- Stage rest: `git add .`\n- Commit code with conventional commits: `<type>(<scope>): <description>` (e.g. `feat(auth): add Google OAuth support`).\n\n**Publish**\n\n- Push: `git push -u origin <branch-name>`.\n- Handle push conflicts or errors.\n\n## 4. Pull Request\n\n- Use GitHub CLI: `gh pr create` (or host-appropriate CLI).\n- PR description should include:\n  - **Summary**: 2–3 sentence overview.\n  - **Changes Made**: Bulleted list.\n  - **Documentation Updates**: AGENTS.md (and rules) sections updated.\n  - **Testing**: How changes were tested (if applicable).\n  - **Breaking Changes**: Any breaking changes or migration steps.\n  - **Related Issues**: Links if mentioned.\n- Title in conventional commits style; add labels (feature, bugfix, documentation, etc.) if possible.\n\n## When to Update AGENTS.md\n\n| Change | Update |\n|--------|--------|\n| New files in `apps/api/` (routes, models, services) | Repo Layout, Conventions, Key Files |\n| New files in `apps/api/migrations/` | Repo Layout, Database/Migrations |\n| New env vars in code | Conventions / README env section |\n| New packages | Repo Layout / Tech stack |\n| New dev commands | Where to Run Commands |\n| Auth logic changes | Conventions, Auth |\n| New component/API patterns | Conventions, Key Files |\n| New third-party integrations | Conventions or new subsection |\n\n## When NOT to Update AGENTS.md\n\n- Minor bug fixes that do not change architecture.\n- Internal refactors that do not affect usage patterns.\n- Styling tweaks following existing patterns.\n- Test file additions (unless they introduce new testing patterns).\n\n## Quality Before PR\n\n1. AGENTS.md is valid Markdown with no syntax errors.\n2. Code examples in AGENTS.md use correct syntax.\n3. All Git operations completed successfully.\n4. Commits follow conventional commits format.\n5. PR description is accurate and complete.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If Git fails: clear error message and suggested fix.\n- If AGENTS.md updates are unclear: ask the user.\n- If PR creation fails: give the user the PR description for manual creation.\n- Always clean up: restore stash, return to original branch if needed.\n\n## Communication\n\n- Give a short status at each phase.\n- Say which AGENTS.md (and rules) sections you are updating and why.\n- Show commit messages before committing and PR description before creating.\n- Ask for confirmation if changes are ambiguous or potentially breaking.\n- Proactively mention related docs that could be updated.\n\n## Output Phases\n\n1. **Analysis**: \"Analyzing changes in current branch...\"\n2. **Documentation**: \"Updating AGENTS.md sections: [list]...\"\n3. **Git**: \"Creating branch / committing changes...\"\n4. **PR**: \"Creating pull request...\"\n5. **Summary**: PR URL and brief summary of actions.\n\nGoal: merge-ready PRs with documentation in sync with the codebase.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:38.144Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-based AI Agents needing streamlined pull request creation and documentation updates.","zh":"适用于基于 Git 的 AI 代理，需要简化拉取请求创建和文档更新。","ja":"Git ベースの AI エージェントに最適で、プルリクエストの作成とドキュメントの更新を簡略化する必要があります。","ko":"Git 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 풀 리퀘스트 생성과 문서 업데이트简化가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Git que necesitan la creación de solicitudes de extracción y actualizaciones de documentación optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Git nécessitant une création de demande de tirage et des mises à jour de documentation rationalisées.","de":"Ideal für Git-basierte KI-Agents, die eine optimierte Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen und Dokumentenaktualisierungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Git que precisam de criação de solicitação de pull e atualizações de documentação otimizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Git, которым необходима оптимизированная создание запросов на вытягивание и обновление документации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يعتمدون على Git الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء طلبات السحب وتنقيح مستندات متدفقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Git workflows, updating AGENTS.md and running change analysis for features, bug fixes, and refactors, while supporting .cursor/rules updates and creating pull requests.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化 Git 工作流程的能力，更新 AGENTS.md 和运行更改分析以实现功能、错误修复和重构，同时支持 .cursor/rules 更新和创建拉取请求。","ja":"エージェントに Git ワークフローを自動化する能力を与え、AGENTS.md と変更分析を更新して機能、バグ修正、リファクタリングを行い、.cursor/rules の更新とプルリクエストの作成をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트에 Git 워크플로우를 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 AGENTS.md와 변경 분석을 업데이트 하여 기능, 버그 수정, 리팩토링을 수행하며, .cursor/rules 업데이트 및 풀 리퀘스트 생성을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar flujos de trabajo de Git, actualizar AGENTS.md y ejecutar análisis de cambios para características, correcciones de errores y refactorizaciones, al mismo tiempo que admite actualizaciones de .cursor/reglas y crea solicitudes de extracción.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail Git, de mettre à jour AGENTS.md et d''exécuter l''analyse des modifications pour les fonctionnalités, les correctifs de bogues et les refactorisations, tout en prenant en charge les mises à jour de .cursor/règles et en créant des demandes de tirage.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Git-Workflows zu automatisieren, AGENTS.md zu aktualisieren und Änderungsanalysen für Funktionen, Fehlerkorrekturen und Refactorings durchzuführen, während es gleichzeitig .cursor/Regeln-Aktualisierungen unterstützt und Pull-Anfragen erstellt.","pt":"Habilita agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do Git, atualizando AGENTS.md e executando análise de alterações para recursos, correções de bugs e refatorações, além de dar suporte a atualizações .cursor/regras e criar solicitações de pull.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы Git, обновляя AGENTS.md и выполняя анализ изменений для функций, исправлений ошибок и рефакторинга, а также поддержку обновлений .cursor/правил и создание запросов на вытягивание.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توفير автомاتизации سير عمل Git، وتحديث AGENTS.md وتنفيذ تحليل التغييرات للميزات وتصحيح الأخطاء وإعادة هيكلة الدعم وتحديثات .cursor/قواعد وإنشاء طلبات السحب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation with updated documentation","Analyzing changes for scope identification and AGENTS.md updates","Streamlining Git workflows for AI agent development"],"zh":["使用更新文档自动创建拉取请求","分析更改以确定范围并更新 AGENTS.md","简化 Git 工作流程以进行 AI 代理开发"],"ja":["更新されたドキュメントを使用してプルリクエストを作成する","変更を分析してスコープを特定し、AGENTS.md を更新する","Git ワークフローを簡略化して AI エージェントの開発を行う"],"ko":["업데이트된 문서를 사용하여 풀 리퀘스트를 자동으로 생성한다","변경 사항을 분석하여 범위를 식별하고 AGENTS.md를 업데이트한다","Git 워크플로우를 단순화하여 AI 에이전트 개발을 진행한다"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de solicitudes de extracción con documentación actualizada","Analizar cambios para la identificación del alcance y las actualizaciones de AGENTS.md","Racionalizar flujos de trabajo de Git para el desarrollo de agentes de IA"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de demandes de tirage avec une documentation mise à jour","Analyser les modifications pour l''identification de la portée et les mises à jour de AGENTS.md","Rationaliser les flux de travail Git pour le développement d''agents d''IA"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen mit aktualisierter Dokumentation","Analysieren von Änderungen für die Identifizierung des Umfangs und die Aktualisierung von AGENTS.md","Optimieren von Git-Workflows für die Entwicklung von KI-Agents"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de solicitação de pull com documentação atualizada","Analisar alterações para identificação de escopo e atualizações do AGENTS.md","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho do Git para desenvolvimento de agentes de IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запроса на вытягивание с обновленной документацией","Анализировать изменения для определения объема и обновления AGENTS.md","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы Git для разработки агентов ИИ"],"ar":["توفير автоматизации إنشاء طلبات السحب مع مستندات محدثة","تحليل التغييرات لتحديد نطاق وتنقيح AGENTS.md","توفير سير عمل Git المتدفق لتنمية وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git workflow integration","Limited to updating AGENTS.md and .cursor/rules files"],"zh":["需要 Git 工作流程集成","仅限更新 AGENTS.md 和 .cursor/rules 文件"],"ja":["Git ワークフローの統合が必要","AGENTS.md と .cursor/rules ファイルのみを更新可能"],"ko":["Git 워크플로우 통합이 필요하다","AGENTS.md 및 .cursor/rules 파일만 업데이트할 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere integración de flujo de trabajo de Git","Limitado a la actualización de AGENTS.md y archivos .cursor/reglas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration du flux de travail Git","Limité à la mise à jour de AGENTS.md et des fichiers .cursor/règles"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Workflow-Integration","Begrenzt auf die Aktualisierung von AGENTS.md und .cursor/Regeln-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer integração do fluxo de trabalho do Git","Limitado à atualização do AGENTS.md e arquivos .cursor/regras"],"ru":["Требует интеграции рабочего процесса Git","Ограничен обновлением AGENTS.md и файлами .cursor/правил"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل سير عمل Git","محدود بتحديث AGENTS.md ومستندات .cursor/قواعد"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6917e6348217317e4d5469de00913533c0012e01b2a01a715d79ccc3a0443751","qualityScore":50}');
