chitecture.md.","zh":"repo-doc-audit是AIエージェント的一种，用于进行代码仓库文档审计","ja":"repo-doc-auditはAIエージェントの一種で、リポジトリのドキュメント監査を行う","ko":"repo-doc-audit는 AI 에이전트의 일종으로 리포지토리 문서 감사를 수행합니다","es":"repo-doc-audit es una herramienta de auditoría de documentación que analiza la precisión de los archivos README.md y architecture.md","fr":"repo-doc-audit est un outil d''audit de documentation qui analyse la précision des fichiers README.md et architecture.md","de":"repo-doc-audit ist ein Tool zur Prüfung der Dokumentation, das die Genauigkeit der Dateien README.md und architecture.md analysiert","pt":"O que é repo-doc-audit? Uma ferramenta de auditoria de documentação para repositórios de código","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент repo-doc-audit? Инструмент для аудита документации репозиториев кода","ar":"ما هو repo-doc-audit؟ أداة مراجعة توثيق للمستودعات الكود"},"features":{"en":["Produces actionable reports on README.md accuracy for setup, run, and configuration","Audits architecture.md for accuracy and consistency","Optionally provides fixes for identified documentation issues","Supports use cases after large refactors, restructurings, or major feature additions","Generates reports on troubleshooting documentation in README.md","Performs a one-off, repo-wide documentation audit for comprehensive coverage"],"zh":["检查README.md准确性","检查architecture.md准确性","生成文档审计报告","支持大规模代码仓库","支持多种代码仓库类型"],"ja":["README.mdの正確性を確認する","architecture.mdの正確性を確認する","ドキュメント監査レポートを生成する","大規模なコードリポジトリをサポートする","複数のコードリポジトリタイプをサポートする"],"ko":["README.md 정확성 확인","architecture.md 정확성 확인","문서 감사 보고서 생성","대규모 코드 리포지토리 지원","다중 코드 리포지토리 유형 지원"],"es":["Análisis de precisión de los archivos README.md","Análisis de precisión de los archivos architecture.md","Informe de acción para mejorar la documentación","Soluciones opcionales para corregir errores de documentación","Compatible con grandes refactorizaciones y restructuraciones","Ideal para auditorías de documentación después de grandes cambios"],"fr":["Analyse de la précision des fichiers README.md","Analyse de la précision des fichiers architecture.md","Rapport d''action pour améliorer la documentation","Solutions optionnelles pour corriger les erreurs de documentation","Compatible avec les grandes refactorisations et restructurations","Idéal pour les audits de documentation après de grands changements"],"de":["Analyse der Genauigkeit der Dateien README.md","Analyse der Genauigkeit der Dateien architecture.md","Aktionsbericht zur Verbesserung der Dokumentation","Optionale Lösungen zur Korrektur von Dokumentationsfehlern","Kompatibel mit großen Refactorings und Umstrukturierungen","Ideal für Dokumentationsprüfungen nach großen Änderungen"],"pt":["Análise de precisão do arquivo README.md","Verificação da documentação de arquitetura em architecture.md","Geração de relatórios ação para atualizações de documentação","Suporte para refatoração, reestruturação e adições de recursos","Análise de configuração e troubleshooting","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Анализ точности файла README.md","Проверка документации архитектуры в architecture.md","Генерация отчетов для обновления документации","Поддержка рефакторинга, реструктуризации и добавления функций","Анализ конфигурации и устранение неполадок","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تحليل دقة ملف README.md","فحص توثيق الهيكلة في architecture.md","توليد تقارير للتحديثات التوثيقية","دعم إعادة هيكلة واعادة بناء وإضافة ميزات","تحليل التكوين ومعالجة الأعطال","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use repo-doc-audit","repo-doc-audit setup guide","what is repo-doc-audit","repo-doc-audit alternative","repo-doc-audit vs documentation tools","repo-doc-audit install","automated documentation audit","repository documentation audit","README.md audit","architecture.md audit"],"zh":["代码仓库文档审计","AIエージェント","README.md","architecture.md","代码仓库监査","文档审计报告","代码仓库管理","代码质量保证"],"ja":["リポジトリのドキュメント監査","AIエージェント","README.md","architecture.md","コードリポジトリ監査","ドキュメント監査レポート","コードリポジトリ管理","コード品質保証"],"ko":["리포지토리 문서 감사","AI 에이전트","README.md","architecture.md","코드 리포지토리 감사","문서 감사 보고서","코드 리포지토리 관리","코드 품질 보증"],"es":["herramientas de auditoría de documentación","repo-doc-audit","README.md","architecture.md","informe de acción","soluciones de documentación","auditoría de documentación","mejora de documentación","documentación de repositorio"],"fr":["outils d''audit de documentation","repo-doc-audit","README.md","architecture.md","rapport d''action","solutions de documentation","audit de documentation","amélioration de documentation","documentation de référentiel"],"de":["Tools zur Prüfung der Dokumentation","repo-doc-audit","README.md","architecture.md","Aktionsbericht","Lösungen zur Dokumentation","Dokumentationsprüfung","Verbesserung der Dokumentation","Dokumentation von Repositorys"],"pt":["repo-doc-audit","auditoria de documentação","ferramenta de auditoria","manutenção de código","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","README.md","architecture.md","relatórios ação"],"ru":["ИИ Агент repo-doc-audit","аудит документации","инструмент для аудита","поддержка кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","README.md","architecture.md","отчеты для обновления"],"ar":["repo-doc-audit","مراجعة توثيق","أداة مراجعة","صيانة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","README.md","architecture.md","تقارير للتحديث"]}},"owner":"Open-Earth-Foundation","repo":"Query_mechanism_urbind","repoPath":"Open-Earth-Foundation/Query_mechanism_urbind","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"repo-doc-audit","description":"One-off full repository audit for documentation health (docstrings, README, architecture, scripts conventions). Use explicitly when requested.","bodyPreview":"# repo-doc-audit\n\nThis is a **one-off**, repo-wide documentation audit. It is intentionally **not** automatic because it can be expensive and noisy.\n\n## When to use\n\n- Use this skill when the user asks for a **full repo documentation audit** or “is everything up to date?”\n- Use after large refactors, restructurings, or major feature additions.\n\n## Goal\n\nProduce an actionable report (and optionally fixes) across:\n\n- `README.md` accuracy (setup/run/config/troubleshooting)\n- `architecture.md` accur","body":"# repo-doc-audit\n\nThis is a **one-off**, repo-wide documentation audit. It is intentionally **not** automatic because it can be expensive and noisy.\n\n## When to use\n\n- Use this skill when the user asks for a **full repo documentation audit** or “is everything up to date?”\n- Use after large refactors, restructurings, or major feature additions.\n\n## Goal\n\nProduce an actionable report (and optionally fixes) across:\n\n- `README.md` accuracy (setup/run/config/troubleshooting)\n- `architecture.md` accuracy (diagrams and component naming)\n- Script docstrings and runnable-script conventions\n- Consistency between dependency docs (`pyproject.toml`, `requirements.txt`, and lockfiles such as `uv.lock` / `poetry.lock`)\n- Presence of `.env.example` entries for documented env vars\n\n## Audit method (recommended)\n\n### 1) Establish repo “truth” from code and configs\n\n- Identify real entrypoints (commands in `README.md`, modules with `__main__`, top-level scripts).\n- Identify configuration files that control runtime (e.g., model/provider selection, pipeline toggles).\n- Identify output folders and naming conventions from code paths.\n\n### 2) Read and validate key docs against truth\n\n- `README.md`\n  - Commands exist and match actual flags/paths.\n  - Setup instructions match dependency source of truth policy.\n  - Output structure matches code behavior.\n- `architecture.md`\n  - Components referenced exist in the repo.\n  - Diagrams reflect current flow and naming.\n- Module-level READMEs (if present in modules)\n  - Do they describe actual behavior and entrypoints?\n\n### 3) Script/docstring audit (repo-wide)\n\nFor any file that looks runnable (heuristics):\n\n- Located under a `scripts/` folder, OR\n- Mentioned in docs as an entrypoint, OR\n- Contains `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`, OR\n- Imports `argparse` and defines `main()`\n\nCheck:\n\n- Top-level module docstring exists and covers:\n  - Brief\n  - Inputs (each CLI flag should have a short purpose + expected format; env vars should explain what they control)\n  - Outputs\n  - Usage from project root (`python -m ...`)\n- Uses `argparse` for CLI (when runnable).\n- Has `__main__` guard.\n- Avoids side effects at import time.\n- Logging: uses `logging` (not `print`) except intentional CLI UX.\n- Imports: prefer **absolute imports**.\n- Paths: prefer `pathlib.Path`.\n\nAdditionally (repo-wide): check that **every function and method** has a docstring.\n\n- Trivial functions/methods: one-liner docstring is acceptable.\n- Non-trivial or side-effecting functions/methods: docstring should explain inputs/outputs, side effects, and raised exceptions when non-obvious.\n\n### 4) Produce an output report\n\nDeliver a report with:\n\n- **Summary**: 3–6 bullets of highest-impact issues\n- **Findings** grouped by document/file\n- **Fix suggestions**: concrete edits (small, scoped)\n- **Optional automated fixes**:\n  - Only apply if user asked you to fix; otherwise just report.\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- Do not try to enforce style consistency beyond correctness.\n- Do not rewrite large sections unless necessary for accuracy.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:31.676Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Repository Management Agents needing comprehensive documentation audits and accuracy checks for README.md and architecture.md files.","zh":"适合需要对README.md和architecture.md文件进行全面文档审计和准确性检查的存储库管理代理。","ja":"README.mdとarchitecture.mdファイルの包括的なドキュメント監査と精度チェックが必要なリポジトリ管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"README.md 및 architecture.md 파일에 대한 포괄적인 문서 감사 및 정확도 확인이 필요한 저장소 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Repositorios que necesitan auditorías de documentación exhaustivas y comprobaciones de precisión para los archivos README.md y architecture.md.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Référentiels nécessitant des audits de documentation complets et des vérifications d''exactitude pour les fichiers README.md et architecture.md.","de":"Perfekt für Repository-Management-Agenten, die umfassende Dokumentationsaudits und Genauigkeitsprüfungen für README.md- und architecture.md-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Repositório que necessitam de auditorias de documentação abrangentes e verificações de precisão para arquivos README.md e architecture.md.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления репозиторием, которым требуются комплексные аудиты документации и проверки точности для файлов README.md и architecture.md.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المستودع التي تحتاج إلى مراجعة وثائق شاملة وعمليات فحص الدقة للملفات README.md و architecture.md."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough documentation audits, providing actionable reports on setup, run, config, and troubleshooting accuracy, as well as architecture documentation, using Markdown files like README.md and architecture.md.","zh":"赋予代理执行彻底的文档审计，提供有关设置、运行、配置和故障排除准确性的可执行报告，以及使用Markdown文件（如README.md和architecture.md）进行架构文档记录。","ja":"エージェントに包括的なドキュメント監査を実行させ、セットアップ、実行、構成、およびトラブルシューティングの精度に関するアクション可能なレポートを提供し、Markdownファイル（README.mdやarchitecture.mdなど）を使用してアーキテクチャドキュメントを記録します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 문서 감사를 수행하도록 하여 설정, 실행, 구성 및 문제 해결 정확성에 대한 실행 가능한 보고書을 제공하고, Markdown 파일(예: README.md 및 architecture.md)을 사용하여 아키텍처 문서를 기록합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de documentación exhaustivas, proporcionando informes de acción sobre la configuración, ejecución, configuración y precisión de solución de problemas, así como documentación de arquitectura, utilizando archivos Markdown como README.md y architecture.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de documentation complets, fournissant des rapports d''actions sur la configuration, l''exécution, la configuration et la précision de dépannage, ainsi que la documentation d''architecture, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que README.md et architecture.md.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Dokumentationsaudits durchzuführen und handhabbare Berichte über Einrichtung, Ausführung, Konfiguration und Fehlersuche-Genauigkeit sowie Architekturdokumentation bereitzustellen, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien wie README.md und architecture.md.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de documentação abrangentes, fornecendo relatórios de ação sobre a precisão da configuração, execução, configuração e solução de problemas, bem como documentação de arquitetura, usando arquivos Markdown como README.md e architecture.md.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проводить тщательные аудиты документации, предоставляя отчеты с рекомендациями по настройке, запуску, конфигурации и устранению неполадок, а также документацию архитектуры, используя файлы Markdown, такие как README.md и architecture.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إجراء عمليات مراجعة وثائق شاملة، وتقديم تقارير مفعمة بالإجراءات حول دقة الإعداد والتشغيل والتهيئة ومعالجة الأعطال، بالإضافة إلى توثيق الهيكل، باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل README.md و architecture.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing documentation after large refactors","Validating README.md accuracy for setup and troubleshooting","Generating reports on architecture.md consistency"],"zh":["大規模リファクタリング後のドキュメント監査","セットアップとトラブルシューティングのREADME.mdの精度を検証する","アーキテクチャドキュメントの整合性に関するレポートを生成する"],"ja":["大規模リファクタリング後のドキュメント監査","README.mdの設定とトラブルシューティングの精度を検証する","アーキテクチャドキュメントの整合性に関するレポートを生成する"],"ko":["대형 리팩토링 후 문서 감査","설치 및 문제 해결을 위한 README.md 정확도 확인","아키텍처 문서 일관성에 대한 보고서 생성"],"es":["Auditoría de documentación después de grandes refactorizaciones","Validación de la precisión de README.md para la configuración y la solución de problemas","Generación de informes sobre la coherencia de architecture.md"],"fr":["Audit de documentation après des refactorisations importantes","Validation de la précision de README.md pour la configuration et le dépannage","Génération de rapports sur la cohérence de architecture.md"],"de":["Dokumentationsaudit nach großen Refactorings","Überprüfung der README.md-Genauigkeit für Einrichtung und Fehlersuche","Erstellung von Berichten über die Konsistenz von architecture.md"],"pt":["Auditoria de documentação após refatorações grandes","Validação da precisão do arquivo README.md para configuração e solução de problemas","Geração de relatórios sobre a consistência do arquivo architecture.md"],"ru":["Проведение аудита документации после крупных рефакторингов","Проверка точности файла README.md для настройки и устранения неполадок","Генерация отчетов о согласованности файла architecture.md"],"ar":["مراجعة الوثائق بعد إعادة هيكلة كبيرة","التحقق من دقة ملف README.md لإعداد وتصحيح الأعطال","توليد تقارير حول الاتساق في ملف architecture.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Intentionally not automatic due to potential expense and noise","One-off audit, not suitable for continuous monitoring"],"zh":["由于潜在的费用和噪音，故意不进行自动化","一次性审计，不适合持续监控"],"ja":["潜在的な費用とノイズのため、自動化は意図的に行わない","一時的な監査であり、継続的な監視には適していない"],"ko":["잠재적인 비용 및 노이즈로 인해 자동화되지 않음","일회성 감사이므로 지속적인 모니터링에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Intencionalmente no automático debido al posible gasto y ruido","Auditoría de un solo uso, no adecuada para la monitorización continua"],"fr":["Intentionnellement non automatique en raison du coût et du bruit potentiels","Audit ponctuel, non adapté à la surveillance continue"],"de":["Absichtlich nicht automatisch aufgrund der möglichen Kosten und des Lärms","Einmalige Prüfung, nicht geeignet für kontinuierliche Überwachung"],"pt":["Intencionalmente não automático devido ao potencial de despesas e ruído","Auditoria única, não adequada para monitoramento contínuo"],"ru":["Намеренно не автоматический из-за потенциальных расходов и шума","Одноразовая аудит, не подходит для непрерывного мониторинга"],"ar":["غير تلقائي عن قصد بسبب التكاليف المحتملة والضجيج","مراجعة واحدة، غير مناسبة للرصد المستمر"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"dddbda7cd0f9ca909104d04068e1c815a797167fc76855e220964ab4d48f5d5d","qualityScore":50}');
