olding 은 교육용 책의 구조와 콘텐츠를 최적화하는 기술입니다","es":"El book-scaffolding es una técnica para planificar y estructurar libros educativos grandes utilizando la gestión de la carga cognitiva y las mejores prácticas pedagógicas","fr":"Le book-scaffolding est une technique pour planifier et structurer de grands livres éducatifs en utilisant la gestion de la charge cognitive et les meilleures pratiques pédagogiques","de":"Das Book-Scaffolding ist eine Technik zur Planung und Strukturierung großer Bildungsbücher unter Verwendung der kognitiven Belastungsmanagement und der besten pädagogischen Praktiken","pt":"Estruturação de livros é uma técnica de planejamento e organização de conteúdo educacional","ru":"Каркас книги - это техника планирования и организации образовательного контента","ar":"هيكل الكتاب هو تقنية للتخطيط وتنظيم المحتوى التعليمي"},"features":{"en":["Implements 4-Layer Teaching Method for progressive lesson structure","Utilizes Specification Primacy for efficient book planning","Applies AI Three Roles Framework for effective teaching","Manages cognitive load for improved student understanding","Supports just-in-time specification for flexible book development","Follows v4.0.1 constitution alignment for standardized book scaffolding"],"zh":["使用认知负荷管理实现教育书籍的结构规划","采用 4 层教学法（Foundation → Application → Integration → Innovation）","支持 AI 三角色框架（AI Three Roles Framework）","实现就-in-time 规范和教学最佳实践","支持大型教育书籍的搭建和内容优化","使用 Specification Primacy 原则（\"Specs Are the New Syntax\"）"],"ja":["認知負荷管理を使用した教育書籍の構造計画","4 層教法（Foundation → Application → Integration → Innovation）を採用","AI 三役フレームワーク（AI Three Roles Framework）をサポート","ジャストインタイム仕様と教学ベストプラクティスを実現","大型教育書籍の構築と内容最適化をサポート","仕様プライマリ（\"Specs Are the New Syntax\"）原則を使用"],"ko":["교육용 책의 구조 계획을 위한 인지 부하 관리 사용","4 層 교학법（Foundation → Application → Integration → Innovation）採用","AI 3 역 프레임워크（AI Three Roles Framework）지원","정확한 시점의 사양과 교학 최적화 구현","대형 교육용 책의 구축과 콘텐츠 최적화 지원","사양 최우선（\"Specs Are the New Syntax\"）원칙 사용"],"es":["Gestión de la carga cogniti