INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('danstrem2/clawdbot-skill-master-pack/copywriting', 'copywriting', 'danstrem2', 'clawdbot-skill-master-pack', 'community', 'copywriting danstrem2 clawdbot-skill-master-pack community The copywriting skill enables AI agents to generate marketing copy that drives action, targeting specific page purposes and audiences to solve their problems. AIエージェント复制写作专家，撰写清晰、令人信服的市场文案，驱动行动 AIエージェントによるコピーライティングエキスパート。明確で説得力のあるマーケティングコピーを書き、行動を促す AI 에이전트 복사 작성 전문가, 명확하고 설득력 있는 마케팅 복사 작성 및 행동 유도 El copywriting es una habilidad clave para los Agentes de IA, que permite crear marketing copy claro y atractivo para mejorar la conversión y el compromiso del usuario. La rédaction publicitaire est une compétence clé pour les Outils d''IA, qui permet de créer du copywriting marketing clair et attrayant pour améliorer la conversion et l''engagement des utilisateurs. Das Copywriting ist eine Schlüsselkompetenz für KI-Tools, die es ermöglicht, verkaufsförderndes Marketing-Copy zu erstellen, um die Konversion und die Nutzerbeteiligung zu verbessern. O copywriting é uma técnica de escrita que visa criar conteúdo claro e atraente para impulsionar a conversão e o engajamento do usuário Копирайтинг - это техника написания текстов, направленная на создание rõчного и привлекательного контента для повышения конверсий и вовлечения пользователей الكتابة الإعلانية هي تقنية للكتابة تهدف إلى إنشاء محتوى واضح وجذاب لزيادة التحويلات ومشاركة المستخدم what is copywriting copywriting for landing pages how to write conversion copy copywriting vs content writing copywriting setup guide expert copywriting techniques AIエージェント复制写作 市场文案撰写 页面目的分析 受众分析 行动驱动 复制写作技术 AIエージェント工具 Gathers context on page purpose, including primary and secondary actions Identifies ideal customer audiences and their problems to solve Writes marketing copy for specific page types, such as homepages and landing pages Drives action with clear and compelling copy Copywriting is the process of writing clear, compelling, and action-driven marketing copy for various page types, including homepages and landing pages.');
