React и Node.js","Анализ SEO с помощью Python и CLI","Улучшение рейтинга сайтов","Инструменты аудита SEO","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["تحسين مواقع الويب باستخدام React و Node.js","تحليل إدارة محركات البحث باستخدام Python و CLI","تحسين تصنيف المواقع","أدوات تدقيق إدارة محركات البحث","التكامل مع أدوات إدارة محركات البحث","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["程序化SEO","AI智能工具","SEO优化","开发效率","网站性能","React","Node.js","CLI工具"],"ja":["プログラムSEO","AIエージェント","SEO最適化","開発効率","ウェブサイトパフォーマンス","React","Node.js","CLIツール"],"ko":["프로그래밍 SEO","AI 에이전트","SEO 최적화","개발 효율성","웹사이트 성능","React","Node.js","CLI 도구"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de SEO programático","qué es el SEO programático","alternativas a herramientas de SEO","SEO programático vs SEO tradicional","instalación de herramientas de SEO","guía de configuración de SEO programático","herramientas de SEO para desarrolladores","mejores prácticas de SEO programático"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils de SEO programmé","qu''est-ce que le SEO programmé","alternatives aux outils de SEO","SEO programmé vs SEO traditionnel","installation d''outils de SEO","guide de configuration de SEO programmé","outils de SEO pour les développeurs","meilleures pratiques de SEO programmé"],"de":["wie man programmatische SEO-Tools verwendet","was ist der programmatische SEO","Alternativen zu SEO-Tools","programmatischer SEO vs traditioneller SEO","Installation von SEO-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für programmatischen SEO","SEO-Tools für Entwickler","beste Praktiken für programmatischen SEO"],"pt":["como usar SEO programático","o que é SEO programático","ferramentas de SEO para desenvolvedores","SEO programático vs SEO tradicional","instalar SEO programático","guia de configuração de SEO programático","melhorias de SEO para sites","otimização de sites com Python","análise de SEO com React"],"ru":["как использовать программное SEO","что такое программное SEO","инструменты SEO для разработчиков","программное SEO vs традиционное SEO","установить программное SEO","руководство по настройке программного SEO","улучшения SEO для сайтов","оптимизация сайтов с помощью Python","анализ SEO с помощью React"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام إدارة محركات البحث البرمجية","ما هي إدارة محركات البحث البرمجية","أدوات إدارة محركات البحث لمانحين","إدارة محركات البحث البرمجية vs إدارة محركات البحث التقليدية","تثبيت إدارة محركات البحث البرمجية","دليل إعداد إدارة محركات البحث البرمجية","تحسينات إدارة محركات البحث للمواقع","تحسين مواقع الويب باستخدام Python","تحليل إدارة محركات البحث باستخدام React"]}},"owner":"dipenmagdani","repo":"portfolio-v2","repoPath":"dipenmagdani/portfolio-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:09:17Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"programmatic-seo","description":"When the user wants to create SEO-driven pages at scale using templates and data. Also use when the user mentions programmatic SEO, template pages, pages at scale, directory pages, location pages, [keyword] + [city] pages, comparison pages, integration pages, or building many pages for SEO. For auditing existing SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strate","body":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strategy, understand:\n\n1. **Business Context**\n   - What''s the product/service?\n   - Who is the target audience?\n   - What''s the conversion goal for these pages?\n\n2. **Opportunity Assessment**\n   - What search patterns exist?\n   - How many potential pages?\n   - What''s the search volume distribution?\n\n3. **Competitive Landscape**\n   - Who ranks for these terms now?\n   - What do their pages look like?\n   - Can you realistically compete?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Unique Value Per Page\n- Every page must provide value specific to that page\n- Not just swapped variables in a template\n- Maximize unique content—the more differentiated, the better\n\n### 2. Proprietary Data Wins\nHierarchy of data defensibility:\n1. Proprietary (you created it)\n2. Product-derived (from your users)\n3. User-generated (your community)\n4. Licensed (exclusive access)\n5. Public (anyone can use—weakest)\n\n### 3. Clean URL Structure\n**Always use subfolders, not subdomains**:\n- Good: `yoursite.com/templates/resume/`\n- Bad: `templates.yoursite.com/resume/`\n\n### 4. Genuine Search Intent Match\nPages must actually answer what people are searching for.\n\n### 5. Quality Over Quantity\nBetter to have 100 great pages than 10,000 thin ones.\n\n### 6. Avoid Google Penalties\n- No doorway pages\n- No keyword stuffing\n- No duplicate content\n- Genuine utility for users\n\n---\n\n## The 12 Playbooks (Overview)\n\n| Playbook | Pattern | Example |\n|----------|---------|---------|\n| Templates | \"[Type] template\" | \"resume template\" |\n| Curation | \"best [category]\" | \"best website builders\" |\n| Conversions | \"[X] to [Y]\" | \"$10 USD to GBP\" |\n| Comparisons | \"[X] vs [Y]\" | \"webflow vs wordpress\" |\n| Examples | \"[type] examples\" | \"landing page examples\" |\n| Locations | \"[service] in [location]\" | \"dentists in austin\" |\n| Personas | \"[product] for [audience]\" | \"crm for real estate\" |\n| Integrations | \"[product A] [product B] integration\" | \"slack asana integration\" |\n| Glossary | \"what is [term]\" | \"what is pSEO\" |\n| Translations | Content in multiple languages | Localized content |\n| Directory | \"[category] tools\" | \"ai copywriting tools\" |\n| Profiles | \"[entity name]\" | \"stripe ceo\" |\n\n**For detailed playbook implementation**: See [references/playbooks.md](references/playbooks.md)\n\n---\n\n## Choosing Your Playbook\n\n| If you have... | Consider... |\n|----------------|-------------|\n| Proprietary data | Directories, Profiles |\n| Product with integrations | Integrations |\n| Design/creative product | Templates, Examples |\n| Multi-segment audience | Personas |\n| Local presence | Locations |\n| Tool or utility product | Conversions |\n| Content/expertise | Glossary, Curation |\n| Competitor landscape | Comparisons |\n\nYou can layer multiple playbooks (e.g., \"Best coworking spaces in San Diego\").\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Framework\n\n### 1. Keyword Pattern Research\n\n**Identify the pattern:**\n- What''s the repeating structure?\n- What are the variables?\n- How many unique combinations exist?\n\n**Validate demand:**\n- Aggregate search volume\n- Volume distribution (head vs. long tail)\n- Trend direction\n\n### 2. Data Requirements\n\n**Identify data sources:**\n- What data populates each page?\n- Is it first-party, scraped, licensed, public?\n- How is it updated?\n\n### 3. Template Design\n\n**Page structure:**\n- Header with target keyword\n- Unique intro (not just variables swapped)\n- Data-driven sections\n- Related pages / internal links\n- CTAs appropriate to intent\n\n**Ensuring uniqueness:**\n- Each page needs unique value\n- Conditional content based on data\n- Original insights/analysis per page\n\n### 4. Internal Linking Architecture\n\n**Hub and spoke model:**\n- Hub: Main category page\n- Spokes: Individual programmatic pages\n- Cross-links between related spokes\n\n**Avoid orphan pages:**\n- Every page reachable from main site\n- XML sitemap for all pages\n- Breadcrumbs with structured data\n\n### 5. Indexation Strategy\n\n- Prioritize high-volume patterns\n- Noindex very thin variations\n- Manage crawl budget thoughtfully\n- Separate sitemaps by page type\n\n---\n\n## Quality Checks\n\n### Pre-Launch Checklist\n\n**Content quality:**\n- [ ] Each page provides unique value\n- [ ] Answers search intent\n- [ ] Readable and useful\n\n**Technical SEO:**\n- [ ] Unique titles and meta descriptions\n- [ ] Proper heading structure\n- [ ] Schema markup implemented\n- [ ] Page speed acceptable\n\n**Internal linking:**\n- [ ] Connected to site architecture\n- [ ] Related pages linked\n- [ ] No orphan pages\n\n**Indexation:**\n- [ ] In XML sitemap\n- [ ] Crawlable\n- [ ] No conflicting noindex\n\n### Post-Launch Monitoring\n\nTrack: Indexation rate, Rankings, Traffic, Engagement, Conversion\n\nWatch for: Thin content warnings, Ranking drops, Manual actions, Crawl errors\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- **Thin content**: Just swapping city names in identical content\n- **Keyword cannibalization**: Multiple pages targeting same keyword\n- **Over-generation**: Creating pages with no search demand\n- **Poor data quality**: Outdated or incorrect information\n- **Ignoring UX**: Pages exist for Google, not users\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Strategy Document\n- Opportunity analysis\n- Implementation plan\n- Content guidelines\n\n### Page Template\n- URL structure\n- Title/meta templates\n- Content outline\n- Schema markup\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What keyword patterns are you targeting?\n2. What data do you have (or can acquire)?\n3. How many pages are you planning?\n4. What does your site authority look like?\n5. Who currently ranks for these terms?\n6. What''s your technical stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For auditing programmatic pages after launch\n- **schema-markup**: For adding structured data\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison page frameworks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:13:15.895Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing scalable SEO optimization through template-based page generation and data-driven content creation.","zh":"非常适合需要通过模板基于页面生成和数据驱动内容创建实现可扩展SEO优化的AI代理。","ja":"テンプレートベースのページ生成とデータドリブンのコンテンツ作成を通じて拡張可能なSEO最適化が必要なAIエージェントに最適。","ko":"템플릿 기반 페이지 생성 및 데이터 驱动 콘텐츠 생성을 통해 확장 가능한 SEO 최적화를 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una optimización de SEO escalable a través de la generación de páginas basadas en plantillas y la creación de contenido impulsada por datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin d''une optimisation de SEO scalable via la génération de pages basée sur des modèles et la création de contenu pilotée par des données.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine skalierbare SEO-Optimierung durch templatebasierte Seiten generierung und datengetriebene Inhalts erstellung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de otimização de SEO escalável por meio de geração de páginas baseada em templates e criação de conteúdo orientada a dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходима масштабируемая оптимизация SEO посредством генерации страниц на основе шаблонов и создания контента, управляемого данными.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى تحسين محركات البحث القابل للتحجيم من خلال إنشاء صفحات قائم على القوالب وإنشاء المحتوى القائم على البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data, avoiding thin content penalties and providing value to users through structured data and comprehensive content analysis, leveraging protocols like HTML and file formats like .md.","zh":"赋予代理构建大规模SEO优化页面的能力，使用模板和数据，避免薄内容惩罚，并通过结构化数据和综合内容分析为用户提供价值，利用HTML等协议和.md等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントがテンプレートとデータを使用して大規模にSEO最適化されたページを構築する能力を付与し、薄いコンテンツのペナルティを回避し、HTMLなどのプロトコルや.mdなどのファイル形式を利用して構造化されたデータと包括的なコンテンツ分析を通じてユーザーに価値を提供する。","ko":"에이전트가 템플릿과 데이터를 사용하여 대규모로 SEO 최적화된 페이지를 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 얇은 콘텐츠의 페널티를 피하고, HTML 등의 프로토콜과 .md 등의 파일 형식을 활용하여 구조화된 데이터와 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석을 통해 사용자에게 가치를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear páginas optimizadas para SEO a gran escala utilizando plantillas y datos, evitando las penalizaciones por contenido delgado y brindando valor a los usuarios a través de datos estructurados y un análisis de contenido integral, aprovechando protocolos como HTML y formatos de archivo como .md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pages optimisées pour le SEO à grande échelle en utilisant des modèles et des données, en évitant les pénalités pour contenu mince et en fournissant de la valeur aux utilisateurs grâce à des données structurées et à une analyse de contenu complète, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTML et des formats de fichiers comme .md.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, SEO-optimierte Seiten im großen Maßstab zu erstellen, indem sie Vorlagen und Daten verwenden, Thin-Content-Strafen vermeiden und den Benutzern durch strukturierte Daten und eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse Wert bieten, indem sie Protokolle wie HTML und Dateiformate wie .md nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir páginas otimizadas para SEO em larga escala, utilizando templates e dados, evitando penalidades de conteúdo fino e fornecendo valor aos usuários por meio de dados estruturados e análise abrangente de conteúdo, aproveitando protocolos como HTML e formatos de arquivo como .md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать страницы, оптимизированные для SEO, в крупном масштабе, используя шаблоны и данные, избегая штрафов за тонкий контент и предоставляя пользователям ценность посредством структурированных данных и комплексного анализа контента, используя протоколы, такие как HTML, и форматы файлов, такие как .md.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء صفحات محسنة لتحسين محركات البحث على نطاق واسع باستخدام القوالب والبيانات، وتجنب جزاءات المحتوى الرفيع، وتقديم قيمة للمستخدمين من خلال البيانات المنظمة والتحليل الشامل للمحتوى، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTML وتنسيقات الملفات مثل .md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO page generation","Generating data-driven content for product marketing","Optimizing page templates for search engine ranking"],"zh":["自动化SEO页面生成","为产品营销生成数据驱动内容","优化页面模板以提高搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["SEOページ生成の自動化","製品マーケティングのためのデータドリブンのコンテンツ生成","検索エンジンランキングの向上のためのページテンプレートの最適化"],"ko":["SEO 페이지 생성 자동화","제품 마케팅을 위한 데이터 驱动 콘텐츠 생성","검색 엔진 순위 향상을 위한 페이지 템플릿 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de páginas de SEO","Generación de contenido impulsado por datos para marketing de productos","Optimización de plantillas de páginas para el ranking de motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de pages de SEO","Génération de contenu piloté par des données pour le marketing de produits","Optimisation de modèles de pages pour le référencement de moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von SEO-Seiten","Erstellung von datengetriebenem Inhalt für Produktmarketing","Optimierung von Seitenvorlagen für die Suchmaschinenrangliste"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de páginas de SEO","Gerar conteúdo orientado a dados para marketing de produtos","Otimizar modelos de páginas para classificação de mecanismos de busca"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию страниц SEO","Генерировать контент, управляемый данными, для маркетинга продуктов","Оптимизировать шаблоны страниц для рейтинга поисковых систем"],"ar":["تحسين تلقائي لإنشاء صفحات تحسين محركات البحث","إنشاء محتوى قائم على البيانات للتسويق بالمنتجات","تحسين قوالب الصفحات لترتيب محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context","Needs access to .claude/product-marketing-context.md file"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景","需要访问.claude/product-marketing-context.md文件"],"ja":["製品マーケティングのコンテキストが必要",".claude/product-marketing-context.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 배경이 필요",".claude/product-marketing-context.md 파일에 액세스해야 함"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos","Necesita acceso al archivo .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits","A besoin d''un accès au fichier .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"pt":["Exige contexto de marketing de produtos","Necessita acesso ao arquivo .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"ru":["Требует контекста маркетинга продуктов","Требует доступа к файлу .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتجات","يتطلب الوصول إلى الملف .claude/product-marketing-context.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0602e928f430986fa712a31335c915c4b594f51dfbef122e01304b855d724f75","qualityScore":50}');
